      </eAnnotations>
      <body>&lt;HTML>&lt;HEAD>&#xD;
&lt;META content=&quot;MSHTML 6.00.2900.3199&quot; name=GENERATOR>&lt;/HEAD>&#xD;
&lt;BODY>A &amp;lt;&amp;lt;Alias&amp;gt;&amp;gt; class contains a single attribute. This attribute may contain additional information (for example persistence informations).&amp;nbsp;Properties using the &amp;lt;&amp;lt;Alias&amp;gt;&amp;gt; as a type will replace the type of the &amp;lt;&amp;lt;Alias&amp;gt;&amp;gt; attribute.&lt;/BODY>&lt;/HTML></body>
    </ownedComment>
